      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a feeling. it's the reality. they sacrificed everything so i could be this \"success,\" and every time i fail, i'm basically spitting in their faces. i can see the disappointment in their eyes when they don't even have to say anything. i feel like the only way to actually stop being such a burden and a source of shame is to just... stop being the problem. it feels like the weight of my failure is just too much for anyone to carry.",
