      "content": "it just feels so selfish to keep dragging them down with me. like, they think they're helping, but all they're doing is watching me suffer and fail over and over. if i just disappeared, the disappointment would stop. the shame would just... stop for everyone. wouldn't it be easier for them to just remember the person they thought i was, instead of having to deal with the mess i've become? it feels like the only way to actually protect their dignity is to not be part of the picture anymore.",
